    },
    "1. In 1Password, open Settings › Browser.\n2. Click Add Browser and choose Zigzag.\n3. Come back and click 1Password again.\n\n1Password only works with browsers it trusts, so this is a one-time step." : {
      "comment" : "Steps in the note from the 1Password extension's button. Keep each step on its own line starting with its number and a period (1. 2. 3.); the line after the blank line is a note. Settings › Browser and Add Browser are names in 1Password.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1. 在 1Password 中，打开“设置 › 浏览器”。\n2. 点按“添加浏览器”，然后选择 Zigzag。\n3. 回到这里，再次点按 1Password。\n\n1Password 只与它信任的浏览器配合使用，所以这一步只需做一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1Password doesn’t trust Zigzag yet. In 1Password, go to Settings › Browser › Add Browser and choose Zigzag." : {
      "comment" : "Toast when the 1Password app turns Zigzag away. Settings › Browser › Add Browser are names in 1Password; match 1Password's own translation.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1Password 还不信任 Zigzag。请在 1Password 中前往“设置 › 浏览器 › 添加浏览器”，然后选择 Zigzag。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "1Password is waiting for you in its app. Unlock it, or allow Zigzag if it asks." : {
      "comment" : "Toast when the 1Password extension waits on the 1Password app.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "1Password 正在它的 App 中等你。请解锁它；如果它询问，请允许 Zigzag。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A blocker stopped this page" : {
      "comment" : "Title of the page Zigzag shows when a content blocker kept a page from loading.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "内容拦截器拦下了此页面"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A content blocker doesn’t let this page load. If you trust the site, allow it in the blocker, then try again." : {
      "comment" : "Message on the page Zigzag shows when a content blocker kept a page from loading.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "内容拦截器不允许载入此页面。如果你信任这个网站，请在拦截器中允许它，然后再试一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A development site at localhost or 127.0.0.1 that uses its own certificate for https opens without the warning. Only for servers on this Mac, and only the certificate first shown." : {
      "comment" : "Explanation under “Trust certificates of servers on this Mac” in Settings › Developer.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "位于 localhost 或 127.0.0.1、使用自有证书提供 https 的开发网站，打开时不再显示警告。仅限这台 Mac 上的服务器，且只信任它最先出示的证书。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A few of your sign-ins from %@ couldn’t come over, so some sites may ask you to sign in again." : {
      "comment" : "Problem in the Import window. The placeholder is a browser's name, like Chrome. Sign-ins are the sites a browser keeps you signed in to.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 中有少数登录状态未能导入，所以一些网站可能会要求你重新登录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A link you open in a new tab sits under the page it came from. Drag a tab out to make it a tab of its own." : {
      "comment" : "Explanation under “Open ⌘-clicked links under their tab” in Settings › Tabs.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在新标签页中打开的链接会放在它来自的页面下面。把标签页拖出来，它就成为独立的标签页。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A page from a site with no tabs open goes at the bottom." : {
      "comment" : "Explanation under “New tabs open” in Settings › Tabs when Next to Tabs from the Same Site is chosen.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "没有打开标签页的网站，新页面放在底部。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A page from a site with no tabs open goes at the top." : {
      "comment" : "Explanation under “New tabs open” in Settings › Tabs when Next to Tabs from the Same Site is chosen.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "没有打开标签页的网站，新页面放在顶部。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A page from a site with no tabs open goes next to the current tab." : {
      "comment" : "Explanation under “New tabs open” in Settings › Tabs when Next to Tabs from the Same Site is chosen.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "没有打开标签页的网站，新页面放在当前标签页旁边。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A password can’t be empty." : {
      "comment" : "Toast when saving a login with its password cleared.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "密码不能为空。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A playing video follows you in a small player." : {
      "comment" : "Explanation under “Keep videos playing when you switch tabs” in Settings › Tabs.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在播放的视频会在小播放器里跟着你。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A profile has its own extensions, sign-ins, history and favorites. Spaces on the same profile share them." : {
      "comment" : "Under the title of the sheet that makes a profile.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "个人资料有自己的扩展、登录状态、历史记录和收藏。同一份个人资料中的空间共用这些内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A quick look, without losing your place" : {
      "comment" : "Under what's said once a step is done, in the getting-started guide, a card in the window. Peek is a Zigzag feature's name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "看一眼，不离开当前位置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A site covers every port and its subdomains: localhost is localhost:3000 and app.localhost too." : {
      "comment" : "Under the list in Settings › Developer.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一个网站涵盖它的所有端口和子域名：localhost 也包括 localhost:3000 和 app.localhost。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A small window for a quick look at a page. Esc closes it, and ⌘O moves it into your browser window to keep it." : {
      "comment" : "Explanation under “New Zigzag Mini” in Settings › Zigzag Mini: what Zigzag Mini is.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "用一个小窗口快速看一眼页面。按 Esc 关闭，按 ⌘O 移到浏览器窗口中留下。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A tab on %@ is using a lot of energy in the background" : {
      "comment" : "Toast when a tab in the background uses a lot of energy. The site is a domain, like example.com.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 上的一个标签页在后台耗电较多"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A tab on %@ is using a lot of energy. It’ll sleep in %lld minutes." : {
      "comment" : "Toast when a background tab keeps the Mac busy. The site is a domain, like example.com; the number is how many minutes until the tab sleeps. A sleeping tab wakes where it was when you open it.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "A tab on %1$@ is using a lot of energy. It’ll sleep in %2$lld minutes."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ 上的一个标签页耗电较多，%2$lld 分钟后会休眠。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A tab on %@ was using a lot of energy, so it’s asleep now" : {
      "comment" : "Toast after Zigzag put a background tab to sleep because it used a lot of energy. The site is a domain, like example.com. The tab wakes when you open it.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 上的一个标签页耗电较多，已让它休眠"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A tab you’re not using that keeps working hard sleeps until you open it again. To keep a site’s tabs awake, turn on Keep tabs awake in its site controls." : {
      "comment" : "Explanation under “Put busy background tabs to sleep” in Settings › Tabs. Keep tabs awake is the row in the site panel; site controls is the panel by the address.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "没在用却一直占用大量资源的标签页会休眠，再次打开时唤醒。要让某个网站的标签页保持唤醒，请在它的网站设置中打开“标签页保持唤醒”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "AD" : {
