      }
    },
    "Add to Favorites" : {
      "comment" : "A command in the command bar, named as in the menu bar.\nFile menu item.\nItem in a pinned tab's context menu in the sidebar.\nItem in a tab's context menu in the sidebar.\nUndo action name, shown in Edit › Undo.\nUndo action name, shown in the Edit menu as Undo Add to Favorites.",
