    "Ads are blocked again everywhere, extensions run on every site, sites ask again for your camera, microphone, location and notifications, zoom goes back to 100%, dark pages, full screen and cookie banners follow your settings again, and every site’s tabs can sleep in the background." : {
      "comment" : "Message of the sheet that forgets the choices made for single sites.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "广告会在所有网站上重新拦截，扩展会在每个网站上运行，网站会重新询问是否使用你的摄像头、麦克风、位置和通知，缩放会恢复为 100%，深色网页、全屏幕和 Cookie 弹窗会重新跟随你的设置，所有网站的标签页也会在后台照常休眠。"
