    "Connect 1Password to Zigzag" : {
      "comment" : "Title of the note shown from the 1Password extension's button until the 1Password app trusts Zigzag.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "将 1Password 连接到 Zigzag"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connect an App" : {
      "comment" : "A heading in Settings › Automation: how to connect an AI app to Zigzag over MCP.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "连接应用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connect to Zigzag, my web browser, as an MCP server. Use the HTTP transport at %@ and send this header with every request: %@. It works on this Mac only. Once connected, you can list my tabs, open, read and screenshot pages, and click, type and scroll in them. Zigzag never lets you use private windows, passwords or its own pages, and I can stop you on any tab. If you can’t add an MCP server yourself, tell me where to add it in your settings." : {
      "comment" : "Copied by Copy Prompt in Settings › Automation, to paste into an AI app's chat so it connects to Zigzag. The first placeholder is the server's address, the second the Authorization header with its key; keep both as they are.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Connect to Zigzag, my web browser, as an MCP server. Use the HTTP transport at %1$@ and send this header with every request: %2$@. It works on this Mac only. Once connected, you can list my tabs, open, read and screenshot pages, and click, type and scroll in them. Zigzag never lets you use private windows, passwords or its own pages, and I can stop you on any tab. If you can’t add an MCP server yourself, tell me where to add it in your settings."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "以 MCP 服务器的方式连接 Zigzag，也就是我的网页浏览器。使用 HTTP 传输，地址是 %@，每个请求都带上这个请求头：%@。它只在这台 Mac 上可用。连接后，你可以列出我的标签页，打开、读取页面和截图，并在页面中点按、输入和滚动。Zigzag 不会让你使用无痕浏览窗口、密码或它自己的页面，我也可以随时在任何标签页上让你停下。如果你无法自己添加 MCP 服务器，请告诉我在你的设置中哪里添加。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connection" : {
      "comment" : "Row in the site panel: whether the page's connection is secure. On an https page it opens the site's certificate.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "连接"
          }
        }
      }
    },
