            "value" : "它会有自己的窗口和程序坞图标，登录状态和这里一样。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It loads a little slower the first time. You stay signed in." : {
      "comment" : "Message of the sheet that asks before clearing one site's cache.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "第一次载入时会稍慢一些。你会保持登录状态。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It may be busy or down right now. Try again in a moment." : {
      "comment" : "Message on the page Zigzag shows when a page can't load.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它现在可能很忙或无法访问。请稍后再试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It may have been moved, renamed or deleted." : {
      "comment" : "Message on the page Zigzag shows when a page can't load.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它可能已被移动、重新命名或删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It may need more memory than your Mac can spare right now. Close some tabs, then try again." : {
      "comment" : "Message on the page Zigzag shows when a page can't load.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它可能需要比你的 Mac 当前能腾出的更多内存。请关闭一些标签页，然后再试一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It opens beside this one" : {
      "comment" : "Under the split view step's title in the getting-started guide, a card in the window.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它会在这个页面旁边打开"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It sends Zigzag around in a loop. Clearing this site’s cookies often fixes it." : {
      "comment" : "Message on the page Zigzag shows when a page can't load.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它让 Zigzag 陷入了循环跳转。清除此网站的 Cookie 通常可以解决。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It stays at the top of this space" : {
      "comment" : "Under what's said once a step is done, in the getting-started guide, a card in the window.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它会留在这个空间的顶部"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It will be able to" : {
      "comment" : "Heading over the list of what an extension can do, in the sheet that asks before adding it.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它将能够"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It would also be able to" : {
      "comment" : "Heading over the list of what an extension could also do, in the sheet shown when it asks for more access.\nHeading over the list of what an extension's update could also do.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它还将能够"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its extensions and everything they hold, including any wallets, are deleted, along with its sign-ins and history. Make sure you have your recovery phrases. This can’t be undone." : {
      "comment" : "Message of the sheet that asks before deleting data left by a profile that's no longer listed.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它的扩展及其保存的所有内容（包括钱包）都会被删除，登录状态和历史记录也会一并删除。请确认你已保存好恢复短语。此操作不可撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its open tabs reload in %@, with that profile’s sign-ins and extensions. Pages you were filling in may lose what you typed." : {
      "comment" : "Message of the sheet that asks before a space with open tabs is put on another profile. The placeholder is the profile's name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它打开的标签页会在“%@”中重新载入，使用该个人资料的登录状态和扩展。你正在填写的页面可能会丢失已输入的内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Its own tabs and pinned tabs, in its own color" : {
      "comment" : "Under what's said once a step is done, in the getting-started guide, a card in the window.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
