    },
    "Scripts and apps you allow in Privacy & Security › Automation can then read and change any page you have open, signed in or not. Never in private windows." : {
      "comment" : "Explanation under “Allow JavaScript from Apple Events” in Settings › Automation.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "打开后，你在“隐私与安全性 › 自动化”中允许的脚本和应用可以读取和更改你打开的任何网页，无论是否已登录。无痕浏览窗口除外。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Scripts can run JavaScript only in web pages." : {
