    },
    "Tabs" : {
      "comment" : "A section of Settings.\nThe quiet label above today's tabs in the sidebar, below the pinned tabs.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "标签页"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Take Screenshot of Whole Page" : {
      "comment" : "File menu item.\nTooltip of the Capture action in the site panel.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "为整个页面截图"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Taken from “%@”, which has no shortcut now" : {
      "comment" : "Under a shortcut in Settings › Shortcuts, after it took keys from another command; that command's name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "取自“%@”，它现在没有快捷键"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Taking a screenshot of the whole page…" : {
      "comment" : "Toast while Zigzag takes a screenshot of the whole page.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在为整个页面截图…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Talk to an app on your Mac" : {
      "comment" : "One thing an extension can do, in its install sheet and in Settings: exchange messages with an app installed on the Mac.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "与你 Mac 上的 App 通信"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Talk to the 1Password app on your Mac" : {
      "comment" : "One thing an extension can do, in its install sheet and in Settings: exchange messages with an app installed on the Mac.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "与你 Mac 上的 1Password App 通信"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Talk to the Bitwarden app on your Mac" : {
      "comment" : "One thing an extension can do, in its install sheet and in Settings: exchange messages with an app installed on the Mac.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "与你 Mac 上的 Bitwarden App 通信"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Teal" : {
      "comment" : "VoiceOver, in the space editor's color wheel: a color's family.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "青色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tell us what works, what doesn’t, and what you’d like. Email reaches the developer directly. GitHub Issues are public, so leave out anything personal." : {
      "comment" : "Message of the Send Feedback sheet. GitHub Issues is a product name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "告诉我们哪些好用、哪些不好用，以及你想要什么。电子邮件会直接发给开发者。GitHub Issues 是公开的，请不要写入任何个人信息。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text %lld%%" : {
      "comment" : "Toast when Reader's text size changes, like Text 120%.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "文字 %lld%%"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text Replacement" : {
      "comment" : "Edit › Substitutions menu item.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "文本替换"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Text and Colors" : {
      "comment" : "Tooltip of the button in Reader's bar that shows its text and color choices.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "文字和颜色"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Thanks for trying Zigzag. I made it to be a calm home for everything you do on the web. I hope it feels that way." : {
      "comment" : "Thank-you note from the maker at the end of the getting-started guide, a card in the window, signed by him.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "感谢你试用 Zigzag。我做它，是想给你在网上做的一切一个安静的家。希望它给你的感觉也是这样。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That disk can’t be written to" : {
      "comment" : "Why a file couldn't be saved, said after what failed, like “Couldn’t save the page. Not enough space on your Mac.”",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法写入该磁盘"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That folder needs a manifest.json that Zigzag can read. Choose the folder that holds it." : {
      "comment" : "Message of the notice when an unpacked extension can't load. manifest.json is a file name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该文件夹需要一个 Zigzag 能读取的 manifest.json。请选取包含它的文件夹。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That isn’t %@’s primary password. Check it and try again." : {
      "comment" : "Problem in the Import window. The placeholder is a browser's name, like Firefox; primary password is Firefox's own term.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这不是 %@ 的主密码。请检查后再试一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That name or password didn’t work. Try again." : {
      "comment" : "Message in the sheet a site's HTTP sign-in asks with, after a wrong name or password.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该名称或密码无效。请再试一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That tab isn’t in this window." : {
      "comment" : "Error a script gets when it makes a tab from another window the current tab.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该标签页不在这个窗口中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That’s Peek" : {
      "comment" : "Said once a step is done in the getting-started guide, a card in the window.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这就是速览"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That’s Split View" : {
      "comment" : "Said once a step is done in the getting-started guide, a card in the window.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这就是分屏浏览"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That’s every port of %@, not only %@." : {
      "comment" : "Added to the message of the sheet that asks before clearing one site's cache or cookies, on a development site whose address has a port, like localhost:3000. The first placeholder is the site, the second the port's number.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "That’s every port of %1$@, not only %2$@."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这会清除 %1$@ 的所有端口，而不只是 %2$@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That’s switching spaces" : {
      "comment" : "Said once a step is done in the getting-started guide, a card in the window.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这就是切换空间"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Last Hour…" : {
      "comment" : "Item in the Clear History menu on the History page.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "过去一小时…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Page" : {
      "comment" : "A choice for “Full screen videos fill” in Settings › Tabs: a video in full screen fills the page's area in the window, with the sidebar and the rest of the window still there.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "网页"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Whole Screen" : {
      "comment" : "A choice for “Full screen videos fill” in Settings › Tabs: a video in full screen covers the whole screen, as usual.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "整个屏幕"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The Zigzag name, the app icon and the logo are trademarks of Zigao Wang, all rights reserved. They aren’t covered by the Apache License: see [TRADEMARKS.md](TRADEMARKS.md)." : {
      "comment" : "In the Acknowledgments window. Keep the Markdown link [TRADEMARKS.md](TRADEMARKS.md) as it is.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zigzag 名称、App 图标和标志是 Zigao Wang 的商标，保留所有权利。它们不在 Apache License 的授权范围内：请参阅 [TRADEMARKS.md](TRADEMARKS.md)。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The address may have a typo, or your Mac may not be connected to the internet. Check both, then try again." : {
      "comment" : "Message on the page Zigzag shows when a page can't load.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "地址可能有误，或者你的 Mac 可能没有连接到互联网。请检查这两项，然后再试一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The address uses a port kept for other things, like email, so browsers don’t open it." : {
      "comment" : "Message on the page Zigzag shows when a page can't load.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此地址使用的端口留作电子邮件等其他用途，所以浏览器不会打开它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app is deleted from your Applications folder. You stay signed in to the site in Zigzag." : {
      "comment" : "Message of the sheet that removes a site installed as an app.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "应用会从“应用程序”文件夹中删除。你在 Zigzag 中的网站登录状态不受影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The cache makes pages load faster. Cookies keep you signed in." : {
      "comment" : "Explanation under “Website data” in Settings › Privacy.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "缓存能让页面载入更快。Cookie 能让你保持登录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The connection dropped" : {
      "comment" : "Why a download failed, under its name in the downloads panel.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "连接已中断"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The file isn’t protected: anyone who opens it can read every password. Keep it somewhere safe and delete it when you’re done." : {
      "comment" : "Message of the sheet that confirms exporting passwords.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该文件未受保护：任何打开它的人都能读取所有密码。请把它存放在安全的地方，用完后删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The file still holds your passwords unprotected. It’s safer to move it to the Trash." : {
      "comment" : "Import window, after passwords came over from an exported file.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该文件中的密码仍未受保护。将它移到废纸篓会更安全。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The free encyclopedia" : {
      "comment" : "Wikipedia’s tagline, on a sample page in the welcome window’s picture of Zigzag.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "自由的百科全书"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The language you read." : {
      "comment" : "Explanation under “Translate pages into” in Settings › Translation.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你阅读时使用的语言。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The ones you use in %@, each downloaded from the Chrome Web Store and checked as if you added it here. You can turn any of them off in Settings › Extensions." : {
      "comment" : "Import window, when asking before adding the extensions found. The placeholder is a browser's name, like Chrome, or a list of them.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这些是你在 %@ 中使用的扩展，每个都从 Chrome 网上应用店下载，并像你在这里亲自添加时一样经过检查。你可以随时在“设置 › 扩展”中关闭其中任何一个。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The page belongs to an extension that has been removed or turned off. Turn it back on in Settings › Extensions, or close this tab." : {
      "comment" : "Message on the page Zigzag shows when a page can't load.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "此页面属于一个已被移除或关闭的扩展。请在“设置 › 扩展”中重新打开它，或者关闭此标签页。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The page meets the window’s edges instead of floating inside it. Hold ⌥⌘ and drag anywhere on the page to move the window." : {
      "comment" : "Explanation under “Borderless page” in Settings › Appearance. ⌥⌘ are the Option and Command keys.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "页面直接贴合窗口边缘，而不是浮在窗口中。按住 ⌥⌘ 在网页任意位置拖动，即可移动窗口。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The pages you’ve visited, used for suggestions in the command bar." : {
      "comment" : "Explanation under “History” in Settings › Privacy.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你访问过的页面，用于命令栏中的建议。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The profile this was going into has been deleted. Choose another and import again." : {
      "comment" : "Problem in the Import window, when the profile chosen under Into was deleted before the import ran.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "要导入到的个人资料已被删除。请选取其他个人资料，然后重新导入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The profile this was going to has been deleted. Nothing was added." : {
      "comment" : "Toast when the profile chosen in the sheet that adds an extension was deleted before the extension went in.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "要添加到的个人资料已被删除，未添加任何内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The result can’t be given as text. For a promise, put await before it and return its value." : {
      "comment" : "Error a script gets when its JavaScript ends on a value like a promise or a page element.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "结果无法以文本形式返回。如果是 Promise，请在前面加上 await 并 return 它的值。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The secure connection was cut off, often by the network you’re on. Try again, or try another network." : {
      "comment" : "Message on the page Zigzag shows when a page can't load.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "安全连接被切断了，通常是你所在的网络造成的。请再试一次，或换一个网络。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The sidebar sits along the window’s right edge, with the page on its left." : {
      "comment" : "Explanation under “Sidebar on the right” in Settings › Appearance.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "边栏沿窗口右侧边缘放置，页面在它的左边。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The site couldn’t send it" : {
      "comment" : "Why a download failed, under its name in the downloads panel.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "网站无法发送该文件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The site may be down right now. Try again in a moment." : {
      "comment" : "Message on the page Zigzag shows when a page can't load.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "网站现在可能无法访问。请稍后再试。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The site only opens for Macs with a certificate it trusts, often one from work or school." : {
      "comment" : "Message on the page Zigzag shows when a page can't load.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该网站只对带有它信任的证书的 Mac 开放，这种证书通常来自工作单位或学校。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The site refused it" : {
      "comment" : "Why a download failed, under its name in the downloads panel.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "网站拒绝了该请求"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The site’s certificate has expired, or your Mac’s date and time are wrong." : {
      "comment" : "Why a site's certificate can't be trusted, under Show details on the page Zigzag shows for it.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该网站的证书已过期，或者你 Mac 的日期和时间不正确。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The site’s certificate is for a different address, or can’t be trusted. Someone could be pretending to be this site." : {
      "comment" : "Why a site's certificate can't be trusted, under Show details on the page Zigzag shows for it.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该网站的证书属于另一个地址，或者不可信。可能有人在冒充这个网站。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The site’s certificate isn’t valid yet. Check your Mac’s date and time." : {
      "comment" : "Why a site's certificate can't be trusted, under Show details on the page Zigzag shows for it.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该网站的证书尚未生效。请检查你 Mac 的日期和时间。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The site’s certificate wasn’t issued by anyone your Mac trusts. Sites on your own network, like a router, often look like this." : {
      "comment" : "Why a site's certificate can't be trusted, under Show details on the page Zigzag shows for it.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "该网站的证书不是由你的 Mac 信任的机构颁发的。你自己网络上的网站（比如路由器）常常是这样。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The size of the tabs, folders, favorites and address. To make everything on your Mac larger, use Larger Text in System Settings › Displays." : {
      "comment" : "Explanation under “Sidebar size” in Settings › Appearance. Larger Text and System Settings › Displays are macOS's own names.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "标签页、文件夹、收藏和地址栏的大小。若要放大 Mac 上的所有内容，请使用“系统设置 › 显示器”中的“更大字体”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "There’s no tab to run it in." : {
      "comment" : "Error a script gets when it runs JavaScript with no window open.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "没有可以运行它的标签页。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They leave the sidebar. Type a few letters in the address bar to bring one back." : {
      "comment" : "Explanation under “Archive tabs you haven’t used” in Settings › Tabs.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它们会从边栏中移走。在地址栏中键入几个字母即可找回。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "They’re forgotten on this Mac. Tabs, pinned tabs and passwords stay." : {
      "comment" : "Message of the sheet that asks before removing pages a search found from History.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
