          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This password is used on other sites. If one of them leaks, this account is at risk too. Change it on the site, then update it here." : {
      "comment" : "Warning on a reused password in the Passwords window.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这个密码在其他网站上也在使用。只要其中一个泄露，这个账户也会有风险。请在网站上更改它，然后在这里更新。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This site can’t prove it is who it says it is, so Zigzag didn’t open it. Someone could be pretending to be it to see what you send." : {
      "comment" : "Message on the page Zigzag shows for a site whose certificate can't be trusted.",
      "localizations" : {
