    },
    "Uses Autoconsent, by DuckDuckGo." : {
      "comment" : "After the explanation under “Cookie banners” in Settings › Privacy. Autoconsent is the name of DuckDuckGo's open-source library: keep both names as they are.",
      "localizations" : {
