    },
    "Uses Dark Reader, by Dark Reader Ltd." : {
      "comment" : "After the explanation under “Dark pages” in Settings › Appearance. Dark Reader is the name of the open-source dark mode engine, Dark Reader Ltd. its maker: keep both as they are.",
