          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your phone needs to be on the same network as this Mac, and your development server needs to listen on it too, not only on localhost (for most, a host of 0.0.0.0)." : {
      "comment" : "Under the address in the Open on Your Phone sheet of the developer tools. 0.0.0.0 is a server setting, kept as is.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "手机需要和这台 Mac 连接同一个网络，你的开发服务器也需要在这个网络上监听，而不只是 localhost（多数情况下把主机设为 0.0.0.0）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your sign-ins from %@ couldn’t come over, so sites will ask you to sign in again." : {
      "comment" : "Problem in the Import window. The placeholder is a browser's name, like Chrome. Sign-ins are the sites a browser keeps you signed in to.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%@ 中的登录状态未能导入，所以网站会要求你重新登录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your spaces, tabs, favorites and history go back to how they were before the last update, and Zigzag restarts. Logins and passwords aren’t affected." : {
      "comment" : "Message of the sheet that restores the backup.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的空间、标签页、收藏和历史记录会恢复到上次更新之前的样子，然后 Zigzag 会重新启动。登录信息和密码不受影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your tabs and spaces will be right here when you open it again." : {
      "comment" : "Message of the sheet that asks before quitting; “it” is Zigzag.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "下次打开时，你的标签页和空间都会在这里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your top sites" : {
      "comment" : "Feature name in the list of things an extension uses that won’t work in Zigzag.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的常用网站"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your windows and tabs come back as they are. Or it switches the next time you open Zigzag." : {
      "comment" : "Message of the sheet after picking a language in Settings › General.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你的窗口和标签页会原样回来。也可以等下次打开 Zigzag 时再切换。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You’ll be signed out of %@, and its pages load fresh next time." : {
      "comment" : "Message of the sheet that removes one site's data.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你将退出 %@ 的登录，下次会重新载入它的页面。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You’ll be signed out of %@. Other sites aren’t touched." : {
      "comment" : "Message of the sheet that asks before clearing one site's cookies.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你将退出 %@ 的登录。其他网站不受影响。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You’ll be signed out of every site. Your passwords, pinned tabs and history stay." : {
      "comment" : "Message of the sheet that asks before clearing every site's cookies.\nMessage of the sheet that clears cookies.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你将在所有网站上退出登录。你的密码、已固定标签页和历史记录会保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You’re all set" : {
      "comment" : "Title of the Import window when the import is done.\nTitle of the getting-started guide, a card in the window once every step is done.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一切就绪"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You’re offline" : {
      "comment" : "Title of the page Zigzag shows when a page can't load.\nWhy a download failed, under its name in the downloads panel.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你已离线"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You’re signed in to your sites here too, and everything else is in your sidebar. You can bring more over anytime from Settings." : {
      "comment" : "Import window when the import is done and sign-ins came over.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "你在这里也已登录你的网站，其他所有内容都在你的边栏中。你可以随时从“设置”导入更多内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zigao, who makes Zigzag" : {
      "comment" : "Signature under the thank-you note at the end of the getting-started guide, a card in the window. Zigao is the maker's name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zigao，Zigzag 的作者"
