    },
    "Zigzag couldn’t save your tabs and spaces" : {
      "comment" : "Toast when Zigzag can't write its library of spaces and tabs; a reason may follow as its own sentence.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zigzag 未能存储你的标签页和空间"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zigzag follows your Mac’s language unless you pick one here." : {
      "comment" : "Explanation under “Language” in Settings › General.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zigzag 跟随你的 Mac 的语言，除非你在这里另选一种。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zigzag has a blocker built in. Pages load faster, with fewer trackers." : {
      "comment" : "Line under the title of the welcome window’s ad blocking step.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zigzag 内置了拦截器。页面载入更快，跟踪器更少。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zigzag is made by Zigao Wang and is open source under the Apache License, Version 2.0. It builds on the work of others, listed below with their licenses. Thank you." : {
      "comment" : "First paragraph of the Acknowledgments window. “Apache License, Version 2.0” is the license's name.",
      "localizations" : {
