          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zigzag 不会打开此端口"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zigzag writes a short report for your email: its version, your Mac, what went wrong lately and on which sites, and crash and freeze reports. Never the pages’ addresses, your tabs or history. Show Report lets you read it first." : {
      "comment" : "Message of the Report a Problem sheet. “Show Report” is the sheet's other button.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Zigzag 会为你的电子邮件写一份简短的报告：它的版本、你的 Mac、最近出了什么问题以及在哪些网站上，还有崩溃和卡顿报告。绝不包含页面地址、你的标签页或历史记录。点按“显示报告”可以先读一读。"
          }
        }
