    },
    "macOS didn’t let Zigzag read Arc’s history. In System Settings › Privacy & Security › Files & Folders, find Zigzag and turn on Arc, then try again." : {
      "comment" : "Problem in the Import window. Arc is a browser's name; System Settings › Privacy & Security › Files & Folders is macOS's own wording.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 不允许 Zigzag 读取 Arc 的历史记录。请在“系统设置 › 隐私与安全性 › 文件与文件夹”中找到 Zigzag，打开 Arc，然后再试一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS didn’t let Zigzag read Arc’s spaces and pinned tabs. In System Settings › Privacy & Security › Files & Folders, find Zigzag and turn on Arc, then try again." : {
      "comment" : "Problem in the Import window. Arc is a browser's name; System Settings › Privacy & Security › Files & Folders is macOS's own wording.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 不允许 Zigzag 读取 Arc 的空间和已固定标签页。请在“系统设置 › 隐私与安全性 › 文件与文件夹”中找到 Zigzag，打开 Arc，然后再试一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS keeps %@’s data private until you allow it. In System Settings › Privacy & Security › Files & Folders, find Zigzag and turn on %@, then try again." : {
      "comment" : "Problem in the Import window. The placeholder is a browser's name, like Chrome; System Settings › Privacy & Security › Files & Folders is macOS's own wording.",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "macOS keeps %1$@’s data private until you allow it. In System Settings › Privacy & Security › Files & Folders, find Zigzag and turn on %2$@, then try again."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在你允许之前，macOS 会对 %1$@ 的数据保密。请在“系统设置 › 隐私与安全性 › 文件与文件夹”中找到 Zigzag，打开 %2$@，然后再试一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS still keeps it private. One switch in System Settings fixes it." : {
      "comment" : "Under a browser in the welcome window.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 仍在对它保密。在“系统设置”中打开一个开关即可解决。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS will ask for your Mac’s password once. Type it, then click Always Allow." : {
      "comment" : "Welcome window’s import step while importing. Always Allow is macOS's own button.",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "macOS 会询问一次你的 Mac 密码。输入密码，然后点按“始终允许”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "macOS will ask for your Mac’s password to open your passwords and sign-ins. Type it, then click Always Allow." : {
